Everything under games/gravity_defied/ is GPL-2.0, the licence of the
gravity_defied_cpp engine it builds on (rgimad, with work by
AntonEvmenenko and Max Logaev; original J2ME game by Codebrew).

Full GPL-2.0 text: engine/LICENSE-gravity_defied_cpp (copied from
rgimad/gravity_defied_cpp at pin 91bd283).

The engine itself is fetched at that pin during the build and is not
in git. Game data (levels.mrg, sprites) comes from the user's own
J2ME .jar at install time and is never committed.

The menu and keypad digits use a small ASCII bitmap raster of Inter
by Rasmus Andersson, SIL OFL-1.1 (LICENSES/Inter-OFL-1.1.txt). The
Inter TTF is not in this tree.
